    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an ancient tome that holds the sun, moon, mountains, and rivers. Together with my monster mentors, I run a small alchemy shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Do your furnaces use acetylene or LPG?' 'Neither\u2014I use enriched uranium.'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this bizarre, surreal world and reshape the ancient underworld with modern technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The brighter the welding sparks, the clearer the whispers in the dark...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420630/extras/1c157910fcaace4bacc493badccbb9b1.poster.avif?t=1747662740\" width=750 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420630/extras/1c157910fcaace4bacc493badccbb9b1.webm?t=1747662740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420630/extras/1c157910fcaace4bacc493badccbb9b1.mp4?t=1747662740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch monsters + Pick up garbage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ different types of monsters in Classic of Mountains and Sea, each with unique biological characteristics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ different modified welding weapons, each with a different way of capturing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420630/extras/09441c7041e286a0e83213a4018216db.poster.avif?t=1747662740\" width=750 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420630/extras/09441c7041e286a0e83213a4018216db.webm?t=1747662740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the world + Transform the underworld</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancient book world of Feng Shui, dark and cute interweaves to create a Cthulhu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holding modified welding, build the cyber underworld brick by brick</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420630/extras/5cd0538013b883087a0cc881717494be.poster.avif?t=1747662740\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420630/extras/5cd0538013b883087a0cc881717494be.webm?t=1747662740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research formula + Operate alchemy shop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each pill has different effects, weight loss? Poisoning? Aphrodisiac? Hypnosis?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully study the mysterious ancient formula, improve the appearance and sell it at a good price</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420630/extras/cfd8c1a7e595a4bb10be9b461de9450a.poster.avif?t=1747662740\" width=800 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420630/extras/cfd8c1a7e595a4bb10be9b461de9450a.webm?t=1747662740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rescue NPC + Unlock stories</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue the trapped NPC and learn their stories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradually figure out the context behind this world and find the answer to the deepest mystery of hell</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420630/extras/09df1c096a24ffc34ecc0b5d75f33c63.poster.avif?t=1747662740\" width=800 height=291 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420630/extras/09df1c096a24ffc34ecc0b5d75f33c63.webm?t=1747662740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
