o></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the world + Transform the underworld</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancient book world of Feng Shui, dark and cute interweaves to create a Cthulhu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holding modified welding, build the cyber underworld brick by brick</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420630/extras/5cd0538013b883087a0cc881717494be.poster.avif?t=1747662740\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420630/extras/5cd0538013b883087a0cc881717494be.webm?t=1747662740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research formula + Operate alchemy shop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each pill has different effects, weight loss? Poisoning? Aphrodisiac? Hypnosis?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully study the mysterious ancient formula, improve the appearance and sell it at a good price</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420630/extras/cfd8c1a7e595a4bb10be9b461de9450a.poster.avif?t=1747662740\" width=800 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420630/extras/cfd8c1a7e595a4bb10be9b461de9450a.webm?t=1747662740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rescue NPC + Unlock stories</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue the trapped NPC and learn their stories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradually figure out the context behind this world and find the answer to the deepest mystery of hell</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420630/extras/09df1c096a24ffc34ecc0b5d75f33c63.poster.avif?t=1747662740\" width=800 height=291 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420630/extras/09df1c096a24ffc34ecc0b5d75f33c63.webm?t=1747662740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Explore the Underworld in this ghost-catching and potion-making adventure RPG! Wield a welding torch to scavenge junk during the day and brew forbidden pills at night to fulfill the wishes of the lost souls. Just a few dishes with a pot of wine, and enjoy the tale.",
